# ── DO NOT IGNORE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The following are part of the canonical repository and must be committed:
#   data/            — canonical question/service/concept/domain datasets
#   resources/       — canonical AWS SVG icon sources
#   docs/            — audit reports and manifests
#   scripts/         — data and icon tooling
#   public/          — runtime assets generated by scripts (committed for CI)
